{"seq":2,"slug":"recycling-rate-data-accounting","title":"回收率与处置数据核算方法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-endoflife-waste-weee-compliance/treatment-recycling-data/recycling-rate-data-accounting","wordCount":2914,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"回收率与处置数据核算方法\">回收率与处置数据核算方法</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>「这批货报废后回收了多少」在跨境电商语境里像一句运营问话，但它在法规体系里是一个<strong>有明确定义分子与分母的比值</strong>：分母是谁、分子算哪些重量、按什么时点称重、由谁审计，每一层都由法规或标准写死。卖家报错一个数字，后果通常不是「数据不准」，而是<strong>被认定为申报不实</strong>——德国 ElektroG 与法国 AGEC 体系下，申报准确性直接与罚款、补缴乃至平台下架挂钩。</p>\n<p>因此必须先破除一个常见混淆：<strong>回收率不是一个指标，而是三个层级上互不相同的比值</strong>。第一层是法域级的<strong>收集率（collection rate）</strong>，衡量「有多少电子废弃物被收上来」，分母是投放市场的重量，目标写在 WEEE 指令附录 III。第二层是处理设施级的<strong>回收/再循环效率（recycling efficiency）</strong>，衡量「收上来的设备有多少重量被真正循环利用」，分母是<strong>进入处理线的重量</strong>，判据由 EN 50625 系列标准定义。第三层才是企业级的<strong>循环利用率</strong>，即自己产品的报废物流向中最终回到材料循环的比例。</p>\n<p>欧委会环境总署的数据给了一个直观锚点：2022 年欧盟投放市场的电子电器设备（EEE）约 <strong>14.4 百万吨</strong>，收集上来的电子废弃物（WEEE）约 <strong>5 百万吨</strong>，人均仅 <strong>11.2 公斤</strong>（欧盟委员会 WEEE 专题页，environment.ec.europa.eu）。媒体常把「收集率低」说成「回收率低」，而这两个数字的分母根本不同。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[EEE 投放市场 POM&lt;br/&gt;按品类/重量统计] --&gt; B[法域收集率&lt;br/&gt;收集 WEEE ÷ 平均 POM]&#10;    C[消费者/渠道回收] --&gt; D[WEEE 进入处理线&lt;br/&gt;称重 + 去污]&#10;    D --&gt; E[处理设施回收效率&lt;br/&gt;再循环量 ÷ 进入量]&#10;    D --&gt; F[拆解产出流&lt;br/&gt;金属/塑料/玻璃/危废]&#10;    F --&gt; G[再循环 / 能量回收 / 处置]&#10;    B --&gt; H{法域达标判定}&#10;    E --&gt; H&#10;    G --&gt; H&#10;    H --&gt; I[申报核查&lt;br/&gt;2019/2193 数据规则]\">graph TD\n    A[EEE 投放市场 POM&lt;br/&gt;按品类/重量统计] --&gt; B[法域收集率&lt;br/&gt;收集 WEEE ÷ 平均 POM]\n    C[消费者/渠道回收] --&gt; D[WEEE 进入处理线&lt;br/&gt;称重 + 去污]\n    D --&gt; E[处理设施回收效率&lt;br/&gt;再循环量 ÷ 进入量]\n    D --&gt; F[拆解产出流&lt;br/&gt;金属/塑料/玻璃/危废]\n    F --&gt; G[再循环 / 能量回收 / 处置]\n    B --&gt; H{法域达标判定}\n    E --&gt; H\n    G --&gt; H\n    H --&gt; I[申报核查&lt;br/&gt;2019/2193 数据规则]</pre><p>跨境电商卖家直接承担第一层的申报义务（投放量），第二、三层决定 PRO 收取的费率水平。</p>\n<h2 id=\"三种口径-收集率-回收率-循环利用率\">三种口径：收集率、回收率、循环利用率</h2><p>把这三个词并列，是因为它们的差异不在措辞而在<strong>分母</strong>。混淆它们，会把法域层面 37.5% 的收集率误读成「欧洲循环利用率只有 37%」，进而错误估算合规成本。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>口径</th>\n<th>分子</th>\n<th>分母</th>\n<th>目标/典型值</th>\n<th>法规依据</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>收集率</strong>（collection rate）</td>\n<td>收集的 WEEE 重量</td>\n<td>投放市场 EEE 三年平均值</td>\n<td>65%（或 WEEE 生成量的 85%）</td>\n<td>指令 2012/19/EU 附录 III</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>回收效率</strong>（recycling efficiency）</td>\n<td>处理产出的再循环重量</td>\n<td>进入处理线的 WEEE 重量</td>\n<td>按品类 55%–80%</td>\n<td>附录 V + EN 50625</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>循环利用率</strong>（企业级）</td>\n<td>回到材料循环的重量</td>\n<td>企业报废总量</td>\n<td>无统一法定值</td>\n<td>合同/平台政策</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这里有一处对成本影响最大的细节：<strong>「回收（recovery）」包含能量回收，「再循环（recycling）」不包含</strong>。附录 V 因此对每个品类同时给出两个百分比——更高的 recovery 目标与更低的 recycling 目标。处理运营商为达标会把一部分高热值塑料送去焚烧取能，让 recovery 数字好看，但 recycling 数字并不因此上升。</p>\n<p>Eurostat 2023 年的数据（2025 年 10 月发布）把三层关系拉得很清楚：欧盟<strong>收集率 37.5%</strong>（以 2020–2022 三年平均 POM 为分母），人均 <strong>11.6 公斤</strong>；收集上来的 <strong>5.2 百万吨</strong> WEEE 中，处理后<strong>回收（recovered）4.8 百万吨</strong>，其中<strong>再循环或再使用准备 4.3 百万吨</strong>（Eurostat，<em>Waste statistics — electrical and electronic equipment</em>）。即收集环节损失约 40%，处理环节再从 5.2 百万吨掉到 4.3 百万吨的纯再循环量。</p>\n<h2 id=\"法定目标与计算基准\">法定目标与计算基准</h2><p>WEEE 指令的附录 III 与附录 V 是全部核算的法定基准，系统里凡涉及「达标」判定的字段都应能追溯到这两张表。</p>\n<p><strong>收集目标（附录 III）</strong> 分三阶段演进：2015 年底前为<strong>人均 4 公斤</strong>；2016–2018 年为<strong>投放市场三年平均重量的 45%</strong>；<strong>自 2019 年起为三年平均 POM 的 65%，或另一口径——当年 WEEE 生成量的 85%</strong>。成员国二选一，这就是 Eurostat 报告里会同时出现「45% 方法」与「85% 方法」两组达标国家的原因。</p>\n<p><strong>回收与再循环目标（附录 V）</strong> 自 <strong>2018 年 8 月 15 日</strong>起按品类合并组适用（legislation.gov.uk，指令 2012/19/EU 附录 V）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>WEEE 品类组</th>\n<th>回收（recovered）</th>\n<th>再使用准备 + 再循环</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>品类 1 / 4（温控设备 / 大型设备）</td>\n<td>≥ 85%</td>\n<td>≥ 80%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>品类 2 / 3（屏幕 / 灯具）</td>\n<td>≥ 80%</td>\n<td>≥ 70%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>品类 5 / 6（小型设备 / 小型 IT 通信）</td>\n<td>≥ 75%</td>\n<td>≥ 55%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>2023 年的实际达标情况说明了门槛之高：采用 65% 方法的国家中，<strong>仅保加利亚、拉脱维亚、斯洛伐克达标</strong>，捷克以 61.7% 逼近；采用 85% 生成量方法的四个国家（丹麦、匈牙利、卢森堡、波兰）中<strong>只有波兰达标</strong>（Eurostat 2023）。对卖家而言，这意味着 PRO 费率在未来几年只会因达标压力而<strong>上升</strong>。</p>\n<p>计算收集率时，分母的取法本身就有一部专门法规：<strong>欧盟委员会实施条例 (EU) 2017/699</strong> 规定了「投放市场 EEE 重量」与「WEEE 生成量」的<strong>统一计算方法</strong>。前者基于销售与重量数据统计，后者则通过<strong>电器寿命分布模型</strong>由历史投放量推算——用某一年往前若干年的投放量，按各品类的寿命分布加权求和，估算当年「理论上应报废」的重量。这也是为什么 85% 口径达标的国家常年只有个位数：生成量模型给出的分母往往远大于实际收集量。</p>\n<h2 id=\"运营商层面的核算-质量平衡与产出流\">运营商层面的核算：质量平衡与产出流</h2><p>法域级收集率只是故事的一半。真正决定「回收了多少材料」的，是处理设施内部的<strong>质量平衡（mass balance）</strong>。欧盟层面由 <strong>EN 50625 系列</strong>（WEEELABEX 认证体系所实施）统一：EN 50625-1 是通用处理要求，CLC/TS 50625-3-1 是去污规范，EN 50625-2-1/2-2/2-3/2-4 分别覆盖灯具、显示器、温控设备与光伏板，EN 50614 管再使用准备。WEEELABEX 官网披露该认证已覆盖 21 个国家、<strong>2,753 次审核、443 家认证运营商</strong>。</p>\n<p>处理运营商必须为每一批进料记录去向，核心恒等式是质量平衡：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mtext>input</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mtext>recycled</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mtext>energy</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mtext>disposal</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mi>m</mi><mtext>stock</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m_{\\text{input}} = m_{\\text{recycled}} + m_{\\text{energy}} + m_{\\text{disposal}} + \\Delta m_{\\text{stock}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">input</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">recycled</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">energy</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">disposal</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">stock</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mi>m</mi><mtext>stock</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta m_{\\text{stock}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">stock</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是滞留（暂存未处理完）的重量，实践中应趋近于零。运营商层面的<strong>再循环效率</strong>定义为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>η</mi><mtext>recycle</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>m</mi><mtext>recycled</mtext></msub><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mtext>input</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mtext>depollution</mtext></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>100</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\eta_{\\text{recycle}} = \\frac{m_{\\text{recycled}}}{m_{\\text{input}} - m_{\\text{depollution}}} \\times 100\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">recycle</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0797em;vertical-align:-0.9721em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">input</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">depollution</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">recycled</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9721em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100%</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>注意分母减去了 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mtext>depollution</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m_{\\text{depollution}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">depollution</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>——<strong>先扣除去污环节取出的危废</strong>（含汞背光、含铅玻璃、电容器、制冷剂等）。去污取出的危废<strong>必须</strong>单独处理，既不进再循环分子，也不该留在分母里稀释效率。留在分母会系统性低估效率，算进分子就是造假。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[WEEE 进料称重] --&gt; B[去污 depollution]&#10;    B --&gt; C[危废流&lt;br/&gt;单独处置, 不计效率]&#10;    B --&gt; D[可处理物料]&#10;    D --&gt; E[破碎/分选]&#10;    E --&gt; F[金属/塑料/玻璃 -&gt; 再循环或能量回收]&#10;    F --&gt; G[记录产出重量]&#10;    G --&gt; H[质量平衡核验]\">graph TD\n    A[WEEE 进料称重] --&gt; B[去污 depollution]\n    B --&gt; C[危废流&lt;br/&gt;单独处置, 不计效率]\n    B --&gt; D[可处理物料]\n    D --&gt; E[破碎/分选]\n    E --&gt; F[金属/塑料/玻璃 -&gt; 再循环或能量回收]\n    F --&gt; G[记录产出重量]\n    G --&gt; H[质量平衡核验]</pre><p>产出流的<strong>归类</strong>才是争议焦点：同一吨塑料，送去机械再生计入 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mtext>recycled</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m_{\\text{recycled}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">recycled</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（满足 recycling 目标），送去水泥窑取能只计入 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mtext>energy</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m_{\\text{energy}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">energy</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（满足 recovery 但不满足 recycling）。跨境电商若要在合同中主张「高再循环率」，就必须在采购处理服务时要求处理商提供<strong>按品类分列、且区分 recycling 与 recovery 的产出证明</strong>，而非笼统的「回收率」证书。</p>\n<h2 id=\"数据申报与核查\">数据申报与核查</h2><p>数字要能穿过审计，靠的不是算术而是<strong>申报规则</strong>。欧盟在指令之上叠了两部实施法规：<strong>实施条例 (EU) 2017/699</strong> 统一定义两个分母的算法，使各国可比；<strong>实施决定 (EU) 2019/2193</strong> 规定数据<strong>计算、验证、报告与数据格式</strong>的共同规则（欧盟委员会 WEEE 专题页，environment.ec.europa.eu）。</p>\n<p>在企业层面，申报链条是：<strong>卖家 → PRO/登记处 → 成员国主管机关 → Eurostat</strong>。德国体系下由 <strong>Stiftung EAR</strong> 集中管理，卖家须按品牌与品类提交数量申报（Mengenmeldung），申报重量通常按<strong>台数 × 品类标准重量</strong>折算；超过法定阈值还须提交审计师签署的<strong>完整性声明（Vollständigkeitserklärung）</strong>。这里有一处最现实的核算陷阱：<strong>按标准重量折算 vs 按实测重量申报</strong>。若产品明显重于同类标准值（例如带大电池的储能设备），按台数 × 标准重量会系统性少报，长期看是审计风险敞口。</p>\n<p>核查的技术核心是<strong>称重</strong>。EN 50625 要求进料与产出均有过磅记录，且须可追溯至批次。跨境卖家能拿到的通常是 PRO 出具的<strong>参与证明与申报回执</strong>，而非运营商级的过磅单；因此真正能自证的只有「投放量」这一端。这也是为什么义务主体识别（见 <a href=\"../endoflife-obligation-subject/epr-producer-obligation-model\">EPR 生产者责任延伸义务模型</a>）比核算本身更优先：<strong>申报主体错了，所有数字都无效</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"跨境电商实践-把核算做进系统\">跨境电商实践：把核算做进系统</h2><p>把上述规则落到工程上，需要三个可编程的实体：<strong>投放量记录、申报期间、处理链路凭证</strong>。缺少任何一个，核算都只能靠人工拼表，而人工拼表恰恰是审计最不信任的形态。字段设计应至少包含 SKU 级的<strong>品类代码、品牌、单件实测重量（kg）、单位数、投放国家、投放日期</strong>——有了它们，投放量、标准重量折算值、以及按品类归集到附录 V 目标组的重量都能直接算出。很多团队把重量塞进商品描述文本，导致每次申报都要重新估算，这是最常见的返工来源。</p>\n<p>一个必须写进系统的判断规则：<strong>同一台设备在多法域只在一处计入首次投放</strong>。若货先入德国仓再转售至法国，两国申报口径可能因「首次投放地」认定不同而分属两地，简单按发货国累加会同时<strong>高估德国、漏报法国</strong>。渠道结构决定了 WEEE 最终在哪国被收集、计入哪国的收集率，从而影响你在该国的费率（见 <a href=\"../waste-collection-network/takeback-channel-network-model\">回收渠道网络模型</a>）。</p>\n<p>中国的《废弃电器电子产品回收处理管理条例》及配套处理基金制度则走<strong>生产者缴纳基金 → 补贴合规拆解企业</strong>的路径，核算基于<strong>拆解量</strong>而非投放量，与欧盟的 POM 分母是两套模型，数值不可互换。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>回收率是三层不同的比值</strong>：法域收集率（分母 = 投放量）、处理设施再循环效率（分母 = 进料量去污后）、企业循环利用率。混用分母是最根本的核算错误。</li>\n<li><strong>法定基准</strong>：附录 III 收集目标 65%（或生成量 85%）；附录 V 再循环目标按品类为 80% / 70% / 55%，回收（含能量回收）目标为 85% / 80% / 75%。- <strong>「回收」≠「再循环」</strong>：能量回收计入 recovery 不计入 recycling，两个目标必须分别核验。</li>\n<li><strong>质量平衡是运营商核算的骨架</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mtext>input</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mtext>recycled</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mtext>energy</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mtext>disposal</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mi>m</mi><mtext>stock</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m_{\\text{input}} = m_{\\text{recycled}} + m_{\\text{energy}} + m_{\\text{disposal}} + \\Delta m_{\\text{stock}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">input</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">recycled</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">energy</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">disposal</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">stock</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，且分母须先扣除去污危废。</li>\n<li><strong>申报靠规则而非算术</strong>：2017/699 定义分母算法，2019/2193 规定计算、验证与报送格式，EN 50625 / WEEELABEX 规定运营商端的称重与认证。</li>\n<li><strong>系统落地的最小字段集</strong>：SKU 级品类代码、品牌、实测重量、单位数、投放国、投放日期——缺一即导致申报靠人工估算。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"回收率与处置数据核算方法","id":"回收率与处置数据核算方法"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"三种口径：收集率、回收率、循环利用率","id":"三种口径-收集率-回收率-循环利用率"},{"level":2,"text":"法定目标与计算基准","id":"法定目标与计算基准"},{"level":2,"text":"运营商层面的核算：质量平衡与产出流","id":"运营商层面的核算-质量平衡与产出流"},{"level":2,"text":"数据申报与核查","id":"数据申报与核查"},{"level":2,"text":"跨境电商实践：把核算做进系统","id":"跨境电商实践-把核算做进系统"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"拆解处置与资源化工艺模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-endoflife-waste-weee-compliance/treatment-recycling-data/dismantling-recycling-process"},"next":{"title":"处置商资质核验与数据凭证实操","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-endoflife-waste-weee-compliance/treatment-recycling-data/treatment-vendor-qualification-evidence"}}